 a few of the many reasons you should take a trip to Theatreland.\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What\u2019s great about West End shows?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"London theatre is famous for a reason. Some of the biggest, best and\u00a0longest-running shows\u00a0in the world can be found here.\nIn addition to well-known and beloved London musicals like\u00a0Les Mis\u00e9rables, Phantom Of The Opera,\u00a0Mamma Mia!,\u00a0Disney\u2019s The Lion King, and\u00a0Wicked, there are plenty more productions and plays in London to see. Murder mysteries, thrillers, classic and modern drama, comedies, opera, dance \u2013 the West End has it all. You can also see some of the biggest stars of stage and screen perform live \u2013 as many times you want, we might add \u2013 in some of the best scripts ever written.\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I buy London theatre tickets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can buy tickets right here with us, Official London Theatre. We have plenty of top London shows to choose from and buying methods to suit everyone. We also have prices to suit every budget, making seeing a show even easier.\nOur online booking system is quick and easy to use. Alternatively, if you prefer to buy your tickets in person, you can visit our\u00a0Ticket Booth\u00a0in Leicester Square where our friendly and informed staff will be more than happy to help you decide which show to see.\nOr, if you\u2019re looking to treat someone, buy\u00a0Theatre Tokens. Tokens are a great gift and can be used at more than 300 venues nationwide including all of London\u2019s West End. Even better, they don\u2019t have an expiry date, so that lucky someone can really use them to see any play or musical they want.\nFor more information on booking and the things to look out for, visit our\u00a0How To Buy London Theatre Tickets guide. It\u2019ll tell you about everything there is to know \u2013 from dynamic pricing, to catching show previews \u2013 so you can have all the knowledge you need to make the right choice, every time.\nPlanning a trip from Broadway? Be sure to check out our comprehensive\u00a0Broadway-goers\u2019 Guide to London theater.\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book for the best London theatre shows?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is so much choice in the\u00a0West End\u00a0that London\u2019s best theatre shows are really up to you.\nTo find tickets to top productions, you have to stay up-to-date with\u00a0West End news. Find tickets to the best London shows for you by browsing our listing pages \u2013 we have up-to-date information on all the current productions in the capital so you can make an informed decision.\nFor new and exciting London theatre shows, keep an eye on our\u00a0news and events section. We\u2019ll keep you in the know about all the latest theatre ticket releases, exciting openings and new booking periods you need to know about.\nAs the best London shows can be extremely popular, we recommend you book your seats well in advance and that you have a few dates available. You don\u2019t want to miss the hottest tickets in the West End because you couldn\u2019t do a Tuesday now, do you?\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I buy last minute theatre tickets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Booking in advance is all well and good, but sometimes you need tickets at short notice. For last minute and discount theatre tickets, visit our Ticket Booth in Leicester Square.\nWe offer tickets to top plays and musicals for that day, or the two following days. It\u2019s a quick and easy way to see a show at late notice, and a great way to bag a bargain theatre ticket.\nAnd if you\u2019re finding it difficult to decide, our team at the Ticket Booth know everything there is to know about London\u2019s Theatreland. They\u2019ll be more than happy to help you choose the right show for you.\nThese great priced tickets can also be found by visiting our Today&#8217;s Ticket page.\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get cheap theatre tickets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In addition to our daily offers at the Ticket Booth (formerly TKTS), you can get great deals using our annual ticket promotions. SOLT and Official London Theatre run Kids Week\u00a0in the summer, and the\u00a0Official London Theatre New Year Sale in the winter. Both are designed to make seeing London theatre shows more accessible.\nKids Week gives you the opportunity to entertain children during the summer holidays. It\u2019s our way of encouraging families to see London shows more frequently and start loving theatre. For the whole of the school summer holidays, children aged 5-17 can go to participating shows for free as long they\u2019re accompanied by a full-paying adult.\nEvery January, our Sale offers \u00a310, \u00a320, \u00a330, \u00a340, \u00a350 &amp; \u00a360 tickets to top West End shows. It\u2019s a great way to kick the new year off to a cultural start and to get into the habit of going to see a show in the West End. This year saw dozens of top London shows take part.\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I keep up-to-date with shows in London?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\n\n\n\nBe the first to find out about all the latest theatre news in London by\u00a0signing up to our emails. We\u2019ll keep you up-to-date with all West End announcements, casting news, London theatre ticket releases and more.\n\n\n\n\n"}}]}</script>		</div>
	</div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Explore London&#8217;s Top Genres</strong></h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Official London Theatre offers London theatre tickets for a broad collection of London&#8217;s thriving theatre scene:</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/london-musicals/" data-type="page" data-id="111407309">West End Musicals</a></h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">From long-running blockbusters like <a href="/show/disneys-the-lion-king-92712/"><em>Disney&#8217;s The Lion King</em></a> and <a href="/show/wicked-73606/"><em>Wicked</em></a> to new smash-hits, experience the world’s best scores live.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/plays-in-london/" data-type="page" data-id="111407010">Classic &amp; Modern Plays</a></h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Discover gripping dramas, star-studded comedies, and limited-run productions in historic venues across Theatreland.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/family-friendly-shows/" data-type="page" data-id="111451051">Family Friendly Theatre</a></h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Introduce the next generation to the stage with our curated selection of family-friendly shows and our annual <a href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/kids-week/" data-type="page" data-id="111450705">Kids Week</a> promotion.</p>
</div>
</div>
      </div>
      </div>
</div>
