														<p>Official London Theatre is run by <a class="white underline" href="http://solt.co.uk/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Society of London Theatre (SOLT)</a> a not-for-profit organisation representing the theatre industry. SOLT also runs the <a class="white underline" href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/olivier-awards/">Olivier Awards</a>, <a class="white underline" href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/west-end-live/">West End LIVE</a>, <a class="white underline" href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/todays-tickets/">The Official London Theatre Ticket Booth</a>, <a class="white underline" href="https://www.theatretokens.com/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">Theatre Tokens</a> and <a class="white underline" href="https://officiallondontheatre.com/kids-week/">Kids Week</a>.</p>
